      "comment": "PAW TREACLE (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in third (22.84) behind Jumbuk Sachin at Warragul. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Top chance in this line up. PAW ALLESANDRA (2) was a last-start winner from the inside at Warrnambool over 390m (22.25) after charging straight to the lead, scoring by 1.5 lengths. Must include in calculations. ASTON PASTIZZI (4) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a head (23.40) behind Aston Sunshine at this track. Well-placed to take this out. PYRENEES ACE (8) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
